    "text": "spectacularmag.com\nwebsite\nDurham\nBook Harvest’s Summer Block Party Returns to Durham with 11,000 Free Children’s Books\nBy @SpectacularMag Staff,\n1 days agoDURHAM, NC – Book Harvest’s beloved Summer Block Party is back for its 5th year—offering thousands of free books, hands-on activities, and family fun at Durham Bulls Athletic Park on Saturday, July 19, 2025. This free event brings together families, educators, and community partners for an afternoon...\n1",
